UPDATE businesses SET description = 'Medellin Harrington is a gentlemen''s grooming and barbering business on Harrington Street in District Six, offering barbering, hair styling, beard trims, head shaves and classic men''s haircuts. The parlour is set over two storeys and also offers hot towel shaves, along with manicures, pedicures and massages for clients wanting a fuller grooming visit.

Bookings can be made online, making it straightforward for clients to secure a slot at a time that suits them, and the two-storey setup gives the business room for a fuller range of grooming services than a single-chair barbershop would typically offer. It operates from 99 Harrington Street in District Six, Cape Town.

