-- molteno-road-dental-practice-oranjezicht (researched)
UPDATE businesses SET description = 'Molteno Road Dental Practice is a dental practice on Molteno Road in Oranjezicht, offering general and cosmetic dentistry alongside dental implants, periodontal treatment and emergency dental care. The practice is also set up for teeth whitening, including take-home whitening kits that patients can use after an in-practice consultation with the oral hygienist.

Patients have described a caring, thorough practice where oral hygiene treatments such as whitening are carried out step by step and explained clearly along the way. Weighing routine check-ups against more involved cosmetic and implant work gives the practice the range to handle both everyday visits and bigger dental projects. It is based at 12 Molteno Road, Oranjezicht, Cape Town.

