-- paranga-camps-bay (researched)
UPDATE businesses SET description = 'Paranga is a beachfront restaurant in Camps Bay, trading as the flagship venue of the Kove Collection group and serving a Mediterranean-inspired menu of seafood, sushi and grilled dishes. It was first established in 2002, and since then the restaurant has built the relaxed but upmarket character now associated with Camps Bay''s beachfront.

The setting is part of the appeal: guests can walk straight off the beach into the restaurant for a long lunch that often runs into an early dinner, with Atlantic views as a backdrop. As part of a larger hospitality group, it also has the backing to handle bigger bookings and private events alongside its everyday beachfront dining. It is based at Shop 1, The Promenade, Victoria Road, Camps Bay.

